{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "36", "x": 0.9036148555787364, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03012839302489931, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "through apps like Damai or Maoyan with just a few taps. That said, the real", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.12319506908974809, "w": 0.7783796377034697, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "issue is the monopoly-like control by these platforms, which sometimes leads", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.15152541916388573, "w": 0.7787712830270042, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "to chaotic sales for popular shows. Take Broadway hits like The Phantom of", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.17970752416545568, "w": 0.7789727445612307, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "the Opera or star-studded productions-tickets vanish within minutes, leaving", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.2080378742395933, "w": 0.7789849450307333, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "desperate fans at the mercy of scalpers jacking up prices even threefold.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.23636822431373095, "w": 0.7786408712857644, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Honestly, while technology makes access easier, the system's still stacked", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.26469857438786853, "w": 0.7783575948384017, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "against ordinary theatregoers for high-demand performances.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.2930660423122369, "w": 0.6355326448167535, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "3.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.32139637352567824, "w": 0.026410812568698126, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Well, absolutely! Take traditional Chinese opera as an example- many young", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.32139637352567824, "w": 0.7791843560658838, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "folks find the plots and language heavy-going. That' s why theatres need to", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.3497267990426009, "w": 0.7788866236000346, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "modernize these classics. Take for example, the Youth Edition Peony Pavilion", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.3780571491167385, "w": 0.7790305686351765, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "has shortened the runtime and added subtitles, which made it a hit with", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.40638753691226864, "w": 0.7784448435740896, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "students. On top of that, theatres should boost their social media influence-", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.4347178869864063, "w": 0.7735585042757519, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "imagine promoting shows through short videos or selling creative products", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.4630482747819364, "w": 0.7784884166794567, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "like opera-themed phone cases. Lastly, student discounts are essential since", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.49140337008956114, "w": 0.77856233717115, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "tickets can be unaffordable for them. Without lowering these financial", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.5197337201636988, "w": 0.7786622990011096, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "barriers, it would be difficult to turn young casual viewers into regulars.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.5480641079592289, "w": 0.7298684179364126, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "1.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5763944580333665, "w": 0.021371506039283665, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Well, I' d say the appeal of acting is multi-layered. For starters, there are the", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.5763944580333665, "w": 0.7788647857848742, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "obvious perks like fame and financial rewards, that A-list lifestyle is", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.6047248458288966, "w": 0.7790721937664213, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "glamorous. But beyond that, it' s a career that' s inherently dynamic. Unlike", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.6330551959030343, "w": 0.7784010654188149, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "desk jobs with repetitive tasks, actors get to reinvent themselves constantly-", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.6612743433120499, "w": 0.7737600683349322, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "that must be exhilarating. What really fascinates me, though, is how the", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.6896046933861876, "w": 0.7784885192044104, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "profession taps into that human desire for self-actualization. You' re not just", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.7179351189031102, "w": 0.7788931851970781, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "memorizing lines; you' re-embodying stories that can move people globally. I", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.7462654689772478, "w": 0.7788503297663877, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "mean, where else could you profoundly impact audiences while fulfilling your", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.7745958190513854, "w": 0.7786688605981531, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "own creative potential? That' s pretty powerful stuff.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.8029261691255231, "w": 0.5401385578614443, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "2.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8312565191996607, "w": 0.025806094759918855, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Well, to break it down, I'd highlight the following essential qualities. First and", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.8312565191996607, "w": 0.7786407687608106, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "foremost, strong memorization skills-you see, actors need to absorb scripts", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.8596116899500704, "w": 0.7789895586536546, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "quickly and deliver lines naturally. On top of that, there's emotional", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.8879420400242081, "w": 0.779137502161995, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "intelligence - I mean, the ability to draw on different feelings and portray", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.9162723900983457, "w": 0.7786717312968596, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}